<div class="markdown">
    <h2>What's this?</h2>

    <p>
        The Spankscuary Webring is a hand-built neighbourhood for spanking stories,
        art, history, humour, blogs, archives, and community. It connects independently
        owned sites so readers can move from one to another without relying on search
        engines, social media feeds, or recommendation algorithms.
    </p>

    <p>
        Webrings are an old idea we're bringing back because they still solve a useful
        problem. Each member site links to the ring, making it possible to discover
        other sites through people rather than platforms.
    </p>

    <h2>How to join</h2>

    <p>
        Spankscuary is for independently maintained sites with substantial spanking-related
        content. Personal sites, blogs, story archives, art sites, history projects, and
        other community resources are all welcome.
    </p>

    <p>
        If you have a GitHub account, you can
        <a href="{{ meta.repo }}/compare">open a pull request</a>
        with the name and URL of your site. If your site has an RSS or Atom feed,
        please include that too.
    </p>

    <p>
        Don't use GitHub? That's fine. We'll add another way to request membership shortly.
    </p>

